# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`. These are Cloudflare's documented Turnstile TEST keys, not secrets:
# 1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA always passes, 2x...AA always fails, 3x...AA "token already spent".
# The server answers test secrets locally, so development works offline.
TURNSTILE_SECRET=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
